      "defect": "missing-hypothesis",
      "evidence": "The fact asserts: “A connected orientable manifold has exactly two orientations.” The opened def-connected-space explicitly states: “The empty space and the one-point space are connected in this library.” Empty manifolds are allowed, and def-oriented-smooth-cobordism states: “The empty manifold carries its unique orientation.” Thus the empty manifold is a counterexample to this fact; nonemptiness is required.",
      "severity": "fatal",
